{
  "id": "JHN.19",
  "number": "19",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "John 19",
  "verseCount": 40,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Pilate therefore took Jesus, and scourged him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the soldiers platted a crown of thorns, and put it on his head, and arrayed him in a purple garment; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and they came unto him, and said, Hail, King of the Jews! and they struck him with their hands. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Pilate went out again, and saith unto them, Behold, I bring him out to you, that ye may know that I find no crime in him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus therefore came out, wearing the crown of thorns and the purple garment. And ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " saith unto them, Behold, the man! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When therefore the chief priests and the officers saw him, they cried out, saying, Crucify ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", crucify ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "! Pilate saith unto them, Take him yourselves, and crucify him: for I find no crime in him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Jews answered him, We have a law, and by that law he ought to die, because he made himself the Son of God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Pilate therefore heard this saying, he was the more afraid; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and he entered into the Prætorium again, and saith unto Jesus, Whence art thou? But Jesus gave him no answer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilate therefore saith unto him, Speakest thou not unto me? knowest thou not that I have power to release thee, and have power to crucify thee? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus answered him, Thou wouldest have no power against me, except it were given thee from above: therefore he that delivered me unto thee hath greater sin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Upon this Pilate sought to release him: but the Jews cried out, saying, If thou release this man, thou art not Cæsar’s friend: every one that maketh himself a king speaketh against Cæsar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Pilate therefore heard these words, he brought Jesus out, and sat down on the judgment-seat at a place called The Pavement, but in Hebrew, Gabbatha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now it was the Preparation of the passover: it was about the sixth hour. And he saith unto the Jews, Behold, your King! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They therefore cried out, Away with ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", away with ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", crucify him! Pilate saith unto them, Shall I crucify your King? The chief priests answered, We have no king but Cæsar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then therefore he delivered him unto them to be crucified.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They took Jesus therefore: and he went out, bearing the cross for himself, unto the place called The place of a skull, which is called in Hebrew Golgotha: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "where they crucified him, and with him two others, on either side one, and Jesus in the midst. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Pilate wrote a title also, and put it on the cross. And there was written, JESUS OF NAZARETH, THE KING OF THE JEWS. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This title therefore read many of the Jews, for the place where Jesus was crucified was nigh to the city; and it was written in Hebrew, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " in Latin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " in Greek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The chief priests of the Jews therefore said to Pilate, Write not, The King of the Jews; but, that he said, I am King of the Jews. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilate answered, What I have written I have written.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The soldiers therefore, when they had crucified Jesus, took his garments and made four parts, to every soldier a part; and also the coat: now the coat was without seam, woven from the top throughout. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They said therefore one to another, Let us not rend it, but cast lots for it, whose it shall be: that the scripture might be fulfilled, which saith,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After this Jesus, knowing that all things are now finished, that the scripture might be accomplished, saith, I thirst. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There was set there a vessel full of vinegar: so they put a sponge full of the vinegar upon hyssop, and brought it to his mouth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Jesus therefore had received the vinegar, he said, It is finished: and he bowed his head, and gave up his spirit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Jews therefore, because it was the Preparation, that the bodies should not remain on the cross upon the sabbath (for the day of that sabbath was a high ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "), asked of Pilate that their legs might be broken, and ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " they might be taken away. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The soldiers therefore came, and brake the legs of the first, and of the other that was crucified with him: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but when they came to Jesus, and saw that he was dead already, they brake not his legs: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "howbeit one of the soldiers with a spear pierced his side, and straightway there came out blood and water. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he that hath seen hath borne witness, and his witness is true: and he knoweth that he saith true, that ye also may believe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For these things came to pass, that the scripture might be fulfilled, A bone of him shall not be broken. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And again another scripture saith, They shall look on him whom they pierced.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And after these things Joseph of Arimathæa, being a disciple of Jesus, but secretly for fear of the Jews, asked of Pilate that he might take away the body of Jesus: and Pilate gave ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " leave. He came therefore, and took away his body. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And there came also Nicodemus, he who at the first came to him by night, bringing a mixture of myrrh and aloes, about a hundred pounds. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So they took the body of Jesus, and bound it in linen cloths with the spices, as the custom of the Jews is to bury. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now in the place where he was crucified there was a garden; and in the garden a new tomb wherein was never man yet laid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 19:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There then because of the Jews’ Preparation (for the tomb was nigh at hand) they laid Jesus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.19.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.19.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
